In both `tool/internal/instrument/impl.tmpl` (`HookContextImpl`) and `pkg/hook/hooktest/mock_hook_context.go` (`MockHookContext`), `HookContext` methods `GetKeyData`, `SetKeyData`, and `HasKeyData` perform direct, unguarded type assertions `c.data.(map[string]interface{})`.

